      echo "  Use the web origin that actually serves the site, often Apache,"
      echo "  LiteSpeed, or a CWP vhost on another port or private IP."
      echo "  Common forms are http://127.0.0.1:8080, http://10.0.0.20:8080,"
      echo "  or a host inside the same LAN."
      echo "  If the panel already terminates SSL, keep this reverse layer focused"
      echo "  on proxying and public TLS."
